        "original_id": "aa60473e-4b63-5cb7-a5ba-bb90d91723da",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Stewart Grand Prix, Formula One\n- People: Johnny Herbert, Rubens Barrichello\n- Events: 1999 Formula One season, European Grand Prix, French Grand Prix, 1992 Formula One Indoor Trophy\n- Topics: Constructors' Championship\n\nFacts:\n- Johnny Herbert won the 1992 Formula One Indoor Trophy in a Lotus-Ford.\n- Johnny Herbert is a British racing driver born on 25 June 1964.\n- Johnny Herbert raced in Formula One from 1989 to 2000 for seven different teams.\n- Johnny Herbert won three Formula One races and finished fourth in the 1995 championship.\n- Stewart Grand Prix had its strongest season in 1999.\n- Stewart Grand Prix won one race in 1999 when Johnny Herbert won the European Grand Prix.\n- Stewart Grand Prix took one pole position in 1999 when Rubens Barrichello qualified first at the French Grand Prix.\n- Stewart Grand Prix finished fourth overall in the 1999 Constructors' Championship.",
